# Cloud Build source upload filter for image-build/cloudbuild-hub-gke.yaml.
#
# Derived from gcloudignore-omni, which keeps the web source that the root
# Dockerfile's frontend stage builds (`npm ci && npm run build`). It differs
# in one way: every pattern that names a repo-root file or directory is
# anchored with a leading "/".
#
# WHY: gcloudignore uses gitignore semantics, so a pattern without a slash
# matches at any depth. Unanchored, `agents.md` and `.gemini/` also drop
#   pkg/config/embeds/templates/default/agents.md
#   pkg/config/embeds/templates/default/home/.gemini/
#   resources/templates/default/agents.md
#   resources/templates/default/home/.gemini/
# which are under `//go:embed all:` roots (pkg/config/init.go,
# resources/embed.go). The build still succeeds; those files are just
# missing from the binary. The root .dockerignore anchors its equivalents, so
# with this file the Cloud Build upload carries the same embed-root files as
# a local `docker build --target hub-gke .`.
#
# gcloudignore-omni and the root .gcloudignore are shared by other builds
# and still carry the unanchored patterns; they are deliberately unchanged
# here. cmd/dockerfile_contract_test.go checks the anchoring in this file.
#
# Usage: pass --ignore-file=image-build/gcloudignore-hub-gke to
# gcloud builds submit (see cloudbuild-hub-gke.yaml).

#!include:.gitignore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Directories not needed by omni builds
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
changelog/
docs/
docs-repo/
docs-site/
examples/
extras/
hack/
/internal/
reviews/
scratch/
/scripts/
shared-dirs/
/skills/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web frontend — INCLUDE source for omni (unlike .gcloudignore).
# Only exclude build artifacts and tooling detritus.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
web/node_modules/
web/coverage/
web/.screenshots/
web/.env*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test files — Cloud Build compiles Go but never runs tests
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*_test.go

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts and tool state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.claude/
.design/
.scratch/
.tasks/
.scion/
build/
.build/
testdata/
downloads/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CI / IDE / config files not needed for image builds
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.gemini/
/.geminiignore
/.github/
/.gitignore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root files not needed for image builds
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/claude.md
/gemini.md
/.claudeignore
/.dockerignore
/.coordinator-state.md
/.eng-manager-state.md
/agents.md
/CHANGELOG.md
/GLOSSARY.md
/LICENSE
/Makefile
/README.md
/pr-*-review*.md
